L293: Dietary intake of vitamin C
L294: Fig. 2. (a) Daily fruit and vegetable consumption and (b) vitamin C intake by the study
L295: participants. (■), Total fruit and vegetable intake or vitamin C intake;
L296: ( ), total minus kiwifruit intervention.
